          %h2#references References
          %p Fiber bundles (then spelled fibre-bundles) were originally defined in:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hassler+Whitney"}> Hassler Whitney
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the theory of sphere-bundles
                %strong 26
                2 (1940) 148-153 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.26.2.148"}> doi:10.1073/pnas.26.2.148
                \&amp;rbrack;
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (with focus on
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sphere+bundles"} sphere bundles
          %p Other sources:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Norman+Steenrod"}> Norman Steenrod
                , Section I.7 of
                = succeed "," do
